<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-08T19:49:46.929Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russia is intensifying air and missile strikes on Ukrainian infrastructure, targeting power facilities, the Northern Bridge, and emergency crews, while Ukrainian forces are hitting Russian missile launchers, air-defence systems in Bryansk Oblast and the Saratov oil refinery. Iran has delivered a secret Khamenei message to Putin as Moscow pursues a gas pipeline deal, and Azerbaijan and Ukraine have signed new energy-defence and trade agreements, with Zelensky urging Latin America to help rebuild Ukraine's power grid. Europe will join US-mediated talks in Abu Dhabi, and space is becoming a critical domain in the war. 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/07/ukraine-russian-strikes-hit-kyiv-region-damaging-infrastructure&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261108-europe-will-take-part-us-mediated-ukraine-peace-talks-abu-dhabi-french-fm-says&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/iran-delivers-secret-khamenei-message-to-putin-as-moscow-pushes-gas-pipeline-deal&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/azerbaijan-and-ukraine-forge-new-energy-defence-and-trade-agreements&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/asia/china-trump-putin-xi-summit.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/05/spain-zelensky-urges-latin-america-to-help-repair-ukraines-power-grid&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPc0cyNF81QU52YlVHeldGQmRqZjVfZnV4a1NBQUg5T3BLR0JFUVlfbzlJbkR0WFdPcTF5emdWOEZXNWdMSkVwNWJRQ3laU282aGlMMWlXLWdncUppNFdraXBlT2lEbm1ueC1ERHRwWEkzTlgxdmFvNHhySWpsc